[0.005, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[3G\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[38;2;255;255;255myes, implement W07 in Manifest. Read AGENTS.md\u001b[39m                                                                        \r\u001b[2C\u001b[2B\u001b[49m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mSearched for \u001b[1m2\u001b[22m patterns, read \u001b[1m14\u001b[22m files, listed \u001b[1m2\u001b[22m directories, ran \u001b[1m2\u001b[22m shell commands \r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mStill reading Manifest's trade, content and query\u001b[53Gcode to design W07; nothing written yet.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mSearching\u001b[13Gfor\u001b[17G\u001b[1m5\u001b[19G\u001b[22mpatterns,\u001b[29Greading\u001b[37G\u001b[1m7\u001b[39G\u001b[22mfiles,\u001b[46Glisting\u001b[54G\u001b[1m1\u001b[56G\u001b[22mdirectory…\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  ~/pr\u001b[11Gject\u001b[16G/manif\u001b[23Gst/source/tools/console/ManifestConsole.cpp\r\u001b[1B────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\u001b[1B← \u001b[48;2;177;185;249m\u001b[38;2;0;0;0m ☐ Home system \u001b[39m\u001b[49m ☐ Connections  ☐ Admin view  ✔ Submit  →\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[2m│\u001b[3G\u001b[22m\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m\u001b[1mAt spawn, do the starting system's other stations get a stale starting report? The market plan seeds only directly \r\u001b[1B\u001b[22m\u001b[39m\u001b[2m│\u001b[3G\u001b[22m\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m\u001b[1mconnected systems, but Stage 4's acceptance says 'A live/B stale at bootstrap', and both fixtures are one system (so \r\u001b[1B\u001b[22m\u001b[39m\u001b[2m│\u001b[3G\u001b[22m\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m\u001b[1motherwise Brine starts unknown).\u001b[22m\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m❯\u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m1.\u001b[39m \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mSeed them (Recommended)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B     \u001b[38;2;153;153;153mSta\u001b[10Gting reports cover ev\u001b[32Gry \u001b[36Gther station in the starting system plus every station in directly connected systems;\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bmatches Stage 4 and keeps the W15 slice playable.\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m \u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m2.\u001b[39m Unknown\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B     \u001b[38;2;153;153;153mOnly\u001b[11Gneighbouring systems \u001b[36Gseeded, as the marke\u001b[58Gplan reads; Brine is unknown\u001b[87Guntil a ship docks\u001b[106Gthere.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m3. Type something.\r\u001b[1B────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m  4.\u001b[6GChat\u001b[11Gabout\u001b[17Gthis\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mEnter to select · Tab/Arrow keys to navigate · Esc to cancel\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;136;136;136m──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── jettison-0004 ─\u001b[39m\u001b[27;1H\u001b[17;1H"]
