[0.083, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[3G\u001b[1mWhat a player now sees\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5GEach player keeps a saved report of each market they know, with best bid and ask, the totes sold over the last\u001b[116Ghour,\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Band the last sale's price and time.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5GA report is refreshed at the end of every step while any of their ships is docked at that venue. When the last\u001b[116Gship\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bleaves, it freezes as of the step before it left, so trades in the departure step stay unseen.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5GReport\u001b[12Gage is counted in simul\u001b[36Gtion steps\u001b[47Gsince it was observed.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mStarting reports:\u001b[22m at\u001b[26Gspawn,\u001b[33Ga\u001b[35Gplayer\u001b[42Ggets\u001b[47Ga\u001b[49Greport\u001b[56Gof\u001b[59Gthe\u001b[63Gother\u001b[69Gstation\u001b[77Gin\u001b[80Gtheir\u001b[86Gsystem\u001b[93Gand\u001b[97Gof\u001b[100Gevery\u001b[106Gstation\u001b[114Gin\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bsystems directly connected\u001b[32Gto it, as you c\u001b[50Ge. These are marked\u001b[70Gstale fr\u001b[79Gm\u001b[81Gthe \u001b[87Gart.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mConnections:\u001b[22m \u001b[19G scenario's systems c\u001b[41Gn now li\u001b[51G \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mconnections\u001b[39m, r\u001b[67Gad in both directi\u001b[86Gns. Both f\u001b[97Gxture\u001b[103G stay\u001b[109Gat one\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bsystem, so in\u001b[19Gthe trading fixture Brine starts stale and anything else is unknown.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mSnapshot:\u001b[22m a player's snapshot lists only thei\u001b[51G own reports, and the Administrator's\u001b[89Glists none. This\u001b[106Gbumped\u001b[113Gthe\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bnetwork pro\u001b[18Gcol to\u001b[25Gversion 4.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mConsole:\u001b[22m \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mobserve\u001b[39m shows l\u001b[30Gve/stal\u001b[38G, age and the prices. The vertical-slice\u001b[79Gtest\u001b[84Gnow\u001b[88Gbuys\u001b[93Gat\u001b[96Gthe\u001b[100Gask\u001b[104Gfrom\u001b[109GAda's\u001b[115Glive\r\u001b[1B    Ore report and sells at the bid from her live Brine report; \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mbook\u001b[39m stays the host's development view.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mSales window:\u001b[19G\u001b[22m\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mmarket.salesWindowSeconds: 3600\u001b[51G\u001b[39mis\u001b[54Ga\u001b[56Gnew\u001b[60Gsetting\u001b[68Gin\u001b[71G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mbalance.yaml\u001b[39m.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mCode layout:\u001b[18G\u001b[22m\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mtrade\u001b[24G\u001b[39mnow\u001b[28Gbuilds\u001b[35Gbefore\u001b[42G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mcompany\u001b[39m,\u001b[51Gbecause\u001b[59Gprovisioning\u001b[72Gseeds\u001b[78Gthe\u001b[82Gstarting\u001b[91Greports.\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3G- \u001b[1mSaved-world hash:\u001b[23G\u001b[22mthe\u001b[27G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mcompany\u001b[35G\u001b[39msuite's\u001b[43Gpinned\u001b[50Ghash\u001b[55Gchanged,\u001b[64Gbecause\u001b[72Gsaves\u001b[78Gnow\u001b[82Ghold\u001b[87Gper-venue\u001b[97Gmarket\u001b[104Grecords\u001b[112Gand\r\u001b[1B    players' reports.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B \u001b[3G\u001b[1mTests:\u001b[22m six new cases in\u001b[27Gthe \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mtrade\u001b[39m suite cover spawn, unseen\u001b[63Gtrades,\u001b[71Gfreezing\u001b[80Gon\u001b[83Gdeparture,\u001b[94Ga\u001b[96Gsecond\u001b[103Gship\u001b[108Gkeeping\r\u001b[1B  coverage, two players seeing different things, the sales window, the connection graph, and save/load including\u001b[114Ga\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
