tions) is implemented in Manifest, and the gate passes with docs updated in \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bboth repositories. Next, say whether to commit both repositories' changes, then start W08, company-funded cargo \r\u001b[1B\u001b[23m\u001b[39m \u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m\u001b[3mupgrades, in a fresh session. (turn off recaps in /config)\r\u001b[2B\u001b[23m\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m❯ \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mcommit and push\u001b[39m                                                                                                       \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m✽\u001b[3GNuclea\u001b[38;2;235;159;127mtin\u001b[38;2;215;119;87mg… \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[3B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[38C\u001b[3B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m · esc to interrupt · ← 1 agent\u001b[39m\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
