[0.016, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[3G \u001b[5Gshortcut in the code, to profile with L26.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mNext:\u001b[9G\u001b[22mW08,\u001b[14Gcompany-funded\u001b[29Gcargo\u001b[35Gupgrades.\u001b[45GI'd\u001b[49Guse\u001b[53GOpus\u001b[58Gat\u001b[61Ghigh\u001b[66Geffort,\u001b[74Gsince\u001b[80Gcharging\u001b[89Gexactly\u001b[97Gonce\u001b[102Gon\u001b[105Ga\u001b[107Gretried\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Brequest is\u001b[14Geasy to get wrong. It doesn't depend on this discussion, so\u001b[74G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m/clear\u001b[39m after commit\u001b[94Ging; the handoff file\u001b[116Gis\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bcurr\u001b[8Gn\u001b[10G.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BI\u001b[5Gdidn't\u001b[12Grun\u001b[16Gclang-tidy\u001b[27Glocally\u001b[35G(CI\u001b[39Gruns\u001b[44Git)\u001b[48Gor\u001b[51Ga\u001b[53Gcross-review\u001b[66G(only\u001b[72Gat\u001b[75Gstage\u001b[81Gclose),\u001b[89Gand\u001b[93GI\u001b[95Gdidn't\u001b[102Gplay\u001b[107Ga\u001b[109Gsession\u001b[117Gin\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bthe real\u001b[12GTUI. The biggest risk is the shor\u001b[46Gcut above: the console's long step\u001b[81G(L26) may get\u001b[95Gslower.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m✻\u001b[3GBaked for 19m 50s · done 5:44 pm\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m※\u001b[3G\u001b[1mrecap: \u001b[22m\u001b[3mW07 (live and stale market observations) is implemented in Manifest, and the gate passes with docs updated in \r\u001b[1B\u001b[23m\u001b[39m \u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m\u001b[3mboth repositori\u001b[19Gs. Nex\u001b[26G, say wh\u001b[36Gher to commit both repositories'\u001b[69Gchang\u001b[76G, then\u001b[83Gstart W08, company-funded\u001b[109Gcargo \u001b[23m\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m\u001b[3mupgrad\u001b[10Gs, \u001b[14Gn a fresh session. (turn off\u001b[43Grecaps\u001b[50Gin /config)\u001b[23m\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\